@startuml
title S1 - Plan redistribution (UC-M4-01): proposed interaction contract
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Operator
boundary UI
control Allocation
control Core
control Reservation
control Charging
Operator -> UI: Open dispatch screen or refresh
UI -> Allocation: plan_redistribution()
Allocation -> Core: Read network snapshot (read-only)
Core --> Allocation: Hubs, vehicles (state, battery), spaces, bays,\nsnapshot version, as_of
Allocation -> Core: Read upcoming demand for the horizon
Core -> Reservation: Confirmed bookings and trips due (public port)
Core -> Charging: Scheduled charging sessions (public port)
Core --> Allocation: Demand per Hub (pickups, returns, bays needed)
Allocation -> Allocation: Load active dispatch tasks (inbound and outbound)
Allocation -> Allocation: Pure planning on the snapshot:\nneed and surplus per Hub, greedy matching,\nvehicle selection, BR-M4-03..07 checks
alt Every Hub is covered
  Allocation --> UI: Empty plan "no task needed", as_of
else Tasks found
  Allocation -> Allocation: Store tasks as Recommended\n(deterministic task key, reason, priority)
  Allocation --> UI: Task list with quantity, priority, reason, as_of
end
opt Snapshot older than the staleness limit
  UI --> Operator: Show snapshot time and a warning
end
UI --> Operator: Show recommendations
@enduml
